ork F1): MET currents evoked by a 10-Hz train of 800-nm glass-probe bundle deflections; the companion leak-side (I_BG) IC50 is archived, not rowed. Hill slope -1.36; cell numbers 7-16. External 1.3 mM Ca2+, -70 mV. REWORK NOTE (review F1): initially judged a zero-row paper (all numerics leak-context); REVOKED by the adversarial review — the Fig 5 legend carries own-data Hill fits for the MET-channel side (TMC-dependent, tip-link-gated currents evoked by 800-nm glass-probe bundle steps) and the author-response section adds MET permeability ratios. The MET-side values are rowed (5 ic50 + 2 ion_selectivity_ratio); the LEAK-side IC50 values (DHS 487 µM Hill -0.65; dTC 82 µM -2.80; amiloride 365 µM -1.67; Gd3+ 524 µM -2.49; La3+ 531 µM -5.67) remain NOT rowed (leak-conductance context out of mechano scope), as do the leak currents (I_Leak -51 ± 3 vs -17 ± 2 pA etc.), resting Vm values, and the figure-only permeation series. [F-004:composite] multi-span assembly (13 fragments all verbatim in archived corpus; assembled quote not contiguous in source; classified 2026-08-31)','mTmc1+mTmc2_OHC_WT_amiloride-block_-70mV_1.3mM-Ca_Hill-fit_Fig5',NULL);
