mns (kT, nm2) have no parameter_kind home -> noted, not rowed.','excised spheroplast patch, E. coli MscL L121C/L122C, two-state fit of Po/Pc vs tension','5','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',127,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
