e is 2006 Mar 15 (benchmark CSV year 2005 kept for the join). DeltaG0 column (kT) has no parameter_kind home -> not rowed.','liposome-reconstituted recombinant E. coli MscL EEKKR (charge reversal), bath pH 7.0, Boltzmann fit of Po vs suction, +30 mV','4','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',129,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(193,'MAIC:BX:00193',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'negative pressure (suction) applied to the patch pipette at +30 mV; Po vs pressure fitted with a Boltzmann distribution | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 8.2','P50',120.2,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'120.2','mm Hg','SUCTION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'RECONSTITUTED_PROTEOLIPOSOME','recombinant 6xHis E. coli MscL (RKKEE wild type and charged-cluster mutants) reconstituted into liposomes',NULL,NULL,5.5,'200 mM KCl, 40 mM MgCl2, 5 mM HEPES-KOH (pH adjusted per condition)','200 mM KCl, 40 mM MgCl2, 5 mM HEPES-KOH (same pH as bath)',30.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'MSCL-EX-00084','TABLE 2. Summary of Boltzmann parameters of the wild-type MscL and the MscL channels harboring mutations within the charged cluster Mutation pH p 1/2 (mm Hg) 1/ α (mm Hg −1 ) Δ G 0 (kT) n RKKEE 7.0 76.3 ± 4.3 5.0 ± 0.6 15.8 ± 1.4 4 EEKKR 7.0 84.2 ± 5.5 5.1 ± 0.2 16.4 ± 1.2 4 RKKEE 5.5 120.2 ± 8.2 4.4 ± 0.2 26.9 ±1.3 4 RKKQQ 7.0 130.3 ± 8.8 5.0 ± 0.4 26.1 ± 1.2 4 QQQEE 7.0 118.6 ± 7.3 5.1 ± 0.4 23.8 ± 1.7 5 RKKQQ 9.5 124.0 ± 11.3 4.9 ± 0.6 25.7 ± 2.2 4 RKKQQ 5.5 89.0 ± 7.7 7.0 ± 0.3 13.0 ± 1.4 4','Table 2 (Boltzmann parameters of WT and charged-cluster mutants)','high','p1/2 defined by the paper as ''the pressure at which the channels are open half the time'' -> true midpoint. Unit printed ''mm Hg'' in the source; unit_db normalized to enum ''mmHg''; suction pressures reported as positive magnitudes. Error type not stated in Table 2 (ANOVA significance markers only) -> blank. Charged-cluster constructs are multi-residue substitutions of the RKKEE cluster (residues 104-108) — not expressible as single short protein changes -> variant_hgvs_short blank, construct in condition_key: EEKKR = charge reversal, RKKQQ = E107Q/E108Q (negative charges neutralized), QQQEE = R/K->Q (positive charges neutralized). RKKEE = wild-type cluster. Print issue is 2006 Mar 15 (benchmark CSV year 2005 kept for the join). DeltaG0 column (kT) has no parameter_kind home -> not rowed.','liposome-reconstituted recombinant E. coli MscL RKKEE (wild type), bath pH 5.5, Boltzmann fit of Po vs suction, +30 mV','4','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',129,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
