s x that anchor. Rowed as the paper''s own stated Table 1 values with the derivation declared -> confidence medium. Descending values are the closing-branch (hysteresis) midpoints. GsMTx4 sensitizes MscS -> modulator_role ''potentiator'' (it inhibits eukaryotic SACs; opposite sign here). [F-004:composite] multi-span assembly (2 fragments all verbatim in archived corpus; assembled quote not contiguous in source; classified 2026-08-31)','excised inside-out patch, MJF465 spheroplast WT MscS, ascending ramp, tension-converted midpoint (Table 1), 10 µM GsMTx4 (cytoplasmic)',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',92,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
