INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(278,'MAIC:BX:00278',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'pneumatic suction pulses (e.g. 215 mm Hg) at constant +15 mV pipette voltage; cosolvents (ficoll 400, dextran, glucose, PEGs) applied to the cytoplasmic (bath) or periplasmic (pipette) side at matched osmolarity (760 mOsm/kg H2O, sorbitol-adjusted) | MODULATOR: ficoll 400 (antagonist) 2 % w/v | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 7.2','P50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,20.0,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20','mm Hg','SUCTION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'INSIDE_OUT','E. coli MJF379 (Frag1 kefA::kan, MscS+ MscL+) giant spheroplasts; recordings focused on the MscS population','E. coli giant spheroplast',NULL,7.2,'150 mM KCl, 400 mM sorbitol, 4 mM CaCl2, 5 mM MgCl2, 5 mM HEPES, pH 7.2 (+ cosolvent as indicated)','150 mM KCl, 400 mM sorbitol, 4 mM CaCl2, 5 mM MgCl2, 5 mM HEPES, pH 7.2',15.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'MSCS-EX-00073','The average shift of the midpoint after channel exposure to 2% ficoll was 20 ± 7.2 mm Hg ( n = 4).','Results (Effect of ficoll...; Fig 2 D)','medium','absolute mmHg endpoints with n -> delta_p50 rows (magnitude positive; direction ''toward higher pressures'' stated in label/quote). PEG concentrations not restated in this sentence (30 mOsm matched fractions) -> modulator_concentration left blank for the PEG rows. tau_inact Y-flag: the paper quantifies inactivation by the time constant ''defined as the inverse of the inactivation rate'' and reports effects as faster/slower (rates/plots); the ONLY numeric taus in text are from ONE double-pulse experiment (''in the control, τ 1 and τ 2 were 0.27 s and 0.26 s, and in the presence of glucose 0.20 s and 0.10 s'') with the paper itself noting ''in other experiments a similar effect was not observed'' -> single-experiment, non-reproduced values archived here, NOT rowed (task directive: rates/no-aggregate -> no tau row). conductance flag: single-channel currents shown but no 