omparative conductances (0.82/1.37 nS) were measured in the same study/liposome system (''was measured to be''); the trailing ''(1)'' cite attaches to the two-thirds rectification remark -> rowed with the ambiguity declared, confidence medium. ''MscSP channels strongly rectify'' + substates — rectification noted, no iv_relation row (task directive). MscSP lacks inactivation (unlike EcMscS) -> no tau rows. Error type: mean ± SE per Table 1 footer.','azolectin liposome-reconstituted MscSP (Silicibacter pomeroyi), single-channel I-V slope at negative voltages, symmetric 250 mM KCl / 90 mM MgCl2','8','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',111,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
