0 and -70 mm Hg (19)'' is a prior-work cite. Table 2 ratios NOT rows: midpoint activation ratio MscL/MscS 2.03, MscL/MscSP 1.31; threshold ratios MscL/MscS 2.00 ± 0.12 (n = 4), MscL/MscSP 1.28 ± 0.08 (n = 7). EcMscS comparative conductances (0.82/1.37 nS) were measured in the same study/liposome system (''was measured to be''); the trailing ''(1)'' cite attaches to the two-thirds rectification remark -> rowed with the ambiguity declared, confidence medium. ''MscSP channels strongly rectify'' + substates — rectification noted, no iv_relation row (task directive). MscSP lacks inactivation (unlike EcMscS) -> no tau rows. Error type: mean ± SE per Table 1 footer.','azolectin liposome-reconstituted E. coli MscS (comparative), single-channel I-V slope at positive pipette voltages, symmetric 250 mM KCl / 90 mM MgCl2',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',111,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
