±875 pA poke etc., P50 24.0±3.6, conductance 27.3±0.3 pS from Saotome et al. 2018) = out-of-family comparison, never rowed. All Imax columns are currents (pA), no parameter_kind home. Gd3+ (60 µM in the pipette) blocks OSCA1.1/1.2 maximal currents by 80%/72% and MmTMEM63A by 75% — percent block, no Hill fit -> no ic50 rows. MmTMEM63A ion-substitution I-V (Control/NMDG-Cl/KCl/Cs-Meth) is qualitative (no E_rev/ratio numbers) -> no ion_selectivity row for TMEM63s. Hyperosmotic (300->620 mmol/kg) whole-cell currents: osmotic gradient without X50/EC50 -> never rowed (round N-standard). Yuan 2014''s smaller conductance values are cited prior work, not rowed. Text-vs-Table error variants: P50 text -58.5±3.7 vs table 58.5±2.4; stretch inact text 24±3.4 / 24.6±4.8 vs table 24.0±3.0 / 24.6±4.7 — table rowed (carries n), variants declared. [F-004:composite] multi-span assembly (2 fragments all verbatim in archived corpus; assembled quote not contiguous in source; classified 2026-08-31)','AtOSCA1.2_HEK-P1KO_cell-attached_stretch_HSPC_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Table1','10','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',131,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
