— percent block, no Hill fit -> no ic50 rows. MmTMEM63A ion-substitution I-V (Control/NMDG-Cl/KCl/Cs-Meth) is qualitative (no E_rev/ratio numbers) -> no ion_selectivity row for TMEM63s. Hyperosmotic (300->620 mmol/kg) whole-cell currents: osmotic gradient without X50/EC50 -> never rowed (round N-standard). Yuan 2014''s smaller conductance values are cited prior work, not rowed. Text-vs-Table error variants: P50 text -58.5±3.7 vs table 58.5±2.4; stretch inact text 24±3.4 / 24.6±4.8 vs table 24.0±3.0 / 24.6±4.7 — table rowed (carries n), variants declared.','MmTMEM63A_HEK-P1KO_cell-attached_stretch_HSPC_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Table1','6','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',131,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
