e etc., P50 24.0±3.6, conductance 27.3±0.3 pS from Saotome et al. 2018) = out-of-family comparison, never rowed. All Imax columns are currents (pA), no parameter_kind home. Gd3+ (60 µM in the pipette) blocks OSCA1.1/1.2 maximal currents by 80%/72% and MmTMEM63A by 75% — percent block, no Hill fit -> no ic50 rows. MmTMEM63A ion-substitution I-V (Control/NMDG-Cl/KCl/Cs-Meth) is qualitative (no E_rev/ratio numbers) -> no ion_selectivity row for TMEM63s. Hyperosmotic (300->620 mmol/kg) whole-cell currents: osmotic gradient without X50/EC50 -> never rowed (round N-standard). Yuan 2014''s smaller conductance values are cited prior work, not rowed. Text-vs-Table error variants: P50 text -58.5±3.7 vs table 58.5±2.4; stretch inact text 24±3.4 / 24.6±4.8 vs table 24.0±3.0 / 24.6±4.7 — table rowed (carries n), variants declared. [F-004:verbatim-semi] '';'' junction(s) confirmed in archived corpus (classified 2026-08-31)','AtOSCA1.2_HEK-P1KO_outside-out_stretch_asymmetrical-NaCl_PCl-PNa_Fig1H',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',131,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(342,'MAIC:BX:00342',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'high-speed pressure clamp (HSPC-1, ALA Scientific) in cell-attached mode; patch suction 0 to -100 mmHg in 10-mmHg increments, 1-s pulses every 5-10 s (input voltages +20 to +120 mV correspond to holding -120 to -20 mV) | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 2.1 (sem)','P50',-64.0,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-64.0','mmHg','PRESSURE_CLAMP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CELL_ATTACHED','Piezo1-knockout HEK293T cells (CRL-3519, ATCC) co-transfected with human TMEM63A (NM_014698, Origene) and GFP (Lipofectamine 3000; recordings 24-72 h after transfection)','HEK293T Piezo1 knockout (CRL-3519)',NULL,7.35,'140 KCl, 1 MgCl2, 10 HEPES, 10 glucose, pH 7.35 (KOH), 290 mmol/kg','130 NaCl, 5 KCl, 1 CaCl2, 1 MgCl2, 10 TEA-Cl, 10 HEPES, pH 7.35 (NaOH), 280 mmol/kg (TEA suppresses K+ channels)',-80.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OSCA-EX-00033','we confirmed that cells transfected with TMEM63A yielded slowly activating noninactivating currents at -80 mV (this potential corresponds to the +80 mV input voltage in cell-attached patch mode as described in methods ; 19.2 ± 3.7 pA, n = 40) with high pressure sensitivities ( P 50 , -64.0 ±2.1 mmHg, Fig. 1 A )','Results (TMEM63A construct verification; Fig 1A)','high','heterologous recombinant human TMEM63A in Piezo1-KO HEK293T with explicit numerics -> confidence high (round ruling 9: heterologous-heavy is the disclosed norm, not penalized). n left blank: the sentence''s n = 40 attaches to the current amplitude, not to the P50 fit. Negative suction as-printed. Prior-work ''> -60 mmHg'' citations in the same paragraph are cited values, never rowed. NILOY ARCHIVE (not rowed): patch amplitudes 19.2 ± 3.7 pA (n = 40, TMEM63A) / 0.7 ± 0.1 pA (n = 32, GFP-only) / 8.4 ± 2.0 pA (n = 26, +Gd3+) are CURRENTS (no parameter_kind home). Gd3+ 30 µM halves the current and leaves P50 unchanged (-65.4 ± 5.3, ROWED as a modulator-conditioned p50) — no Hill fit -> no ic50 row (round ruling: own-data IC50 fits only); GsMTx4 5 µM qualitative. Cell-size covariate strata (Fig 4): >20 pF cells P50 -70 ± 3 mmHg, τACT 672 ± 124 ms (30 cells, 45 ± 4 pF, Imax 111 ± 19 pA); <20 pF cells P50 -66 ± 4 mmHg, τACT 273 ± 34 ms (17 cells, 11 ± 1 pF, Imax 16 ± 2 pA) — archived as covariate analysis (Imax values are currents). Whole-cell equi-biaxial PDMS stretch + GCaMP5 Ca2+ imaging (1-15%, 3-12 s): fluorescence metrics, not channel parameter rows. tau_inact = N explicitly (TMEM63A ''lack[s] inactivation over 5 s''). conductance/ion_selectivity = N (I-V linear, scaling with the driving force; no E_rev value). Error convention: means ± SE (methods). [F-004:verbatim-semi] '';'' junction(s) confirmed in archived corpus (classified 2026-08-31)','hTMEM63A_HEK293T-P1KO_cell-attached_HSPC_0-to--100mmHg_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig1A',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',132,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(343,'MAIC:BX:00343',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'high-speed pressure clamp (HSPC-1, ALA Scientific) in cell-attached mode; patch suction 0 to -100 mmHg in 10-mmHg increments, 1-s pulses every 5-10 s (input voltages +20 to +120 mV correspond to holding -120 to -20 mV) | MODULATOR: Gd3+ (gadolinium) (blocker) 30 µM | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 5.3 (sem)','P50',-65.4,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-65.4','mmHg','PRESSURE_CLAMP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CELL_ATTACHED','Piezo1-knockout HEK293T cells (CRL-3519, ATCC) co-transfected with human TMEM63A (NM_014698, Origene) and GFP (Lipofectamine 3000; recordings 24-72 h after transfection)','HEK293T Piezo1 knockout (CRL-3519)',NULL,7.35,'140 KCl, 1 MgCl2, 10 HEPES, 10 glucose, pH 7.35 (KOH), 290 mmol/kg','130 NaCl, 5 KCl, 1 CaCl2, 1 MgCl2, 10 TEA-Cl, 10 HEPES, pH 7.35 (NaOH), 280 mmol/kg (TEA suppresses K+ channels)',-80.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OSCA-EX-00034','Average currents from TMEM63A-transfected cells exposed to mechanochannel blocker Gd 3+ [30 µM ( 26 )] were reduced by half (8.4 ± 2.0 pA, n = 26, P < 0.05 compared with TMEM63A by one-way ANOVA) and remained pressure sensitive with nearly the same P 50 (-65.4 ± 5.3 mmHg) as those not exposed to Gd 3+ ( Fig. 1 E ).','Results (Gd3+ block; Fig 1E)','high','MODULATOR-CONDITIONED p50 (not an ic50 row): Gd3+ halves the current amplitude but leaves pressure sensitivity unchanged (''nearly the same P50'') — a percent-block statement without a Hill fit cannot produce an ic50 row (round ruling 8). NILOY ARCHIVE (not rowed): patch amplitudes 19.2 ± 3.7 pA (n = 40, TMEM63A) / 0.7 ± 0.1 pA (n = 32, GFP-only) / 8.4 ± 2.0 pA (n = 26, +Gd3+) are CURRENTS (no parameter_kind home). Gd3+ 30 µM halves the current and leaves P50 unchanged (-65.4 ± 5.3, ROWED as a modulator-conditioned p50) — no Hill fit -> no ic50 row (round ruling: own-data IC50 fits only); GsMTx4 5 µM qualitative. Cell-size covariate strata (Fig 4): >20 pF cells P50 -70 ± 3 mmHg, τACT 672 ± 124 ms (30 cells, 45 ± 4 pF, Imax 111 ± 19 pA); <20 pF cells P50 -66 ± 4 mmHg, τACT 273 ± 34 ms (17 cells, 11 ± 1 pF, Imax 16 ± 2 pA) — archived as covariate analysis (Imax values are currents). Whole-cell equi-biaxial PDMS stretch + GCaMP5 Ca2+ imaging (1-15%, 3-12 s): fluorescence metrics, not channel parameter rows. tau_inact = N explicitly (TMEM63A ''lack[s] inactivation over 5 s''). conductance/ion_selectivity = N (I-V linear, scaling with the driving force; no E_rev value). Error convention: means ± SE (methods).','hTMEM63A_HEK293T-P1KO_cell-attached_HSPC_Gd3+-30uM_bath_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig1E',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',132,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(344,'MAIC:BX:00344',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'high-speed pressure clamp (HSPC-1, ALA Scientific) in cell-attached mode; patch suction 0 to -100 mmHg in 10-mmHg increments, 1-s pulses every 5-10 s (input voltages +20 to +120 mV correspond to holding -120 to -20 mV) | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 5.9 (sem)','P50',-69.7,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-69.7','mmHg','PRESSURE_CLAMP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CELL_ATTACHED','Piezo1-knockout HEK293T cells (CRL-3519, ATCC) co-transfected with human TMEM63A (NM_014698, Origene) and GFP (Lipofectamine 3000; recordings 24-72 h after transfection)','HEK293T Piezo1 knockout (CRL-3519)',NULL,7.35,'140 KCl, 1 MgCl2, 10 HEPES, 10 glucose, pH 7.35 (KOH), 290 mmol/kg','130 NaCl, 5 KCl, 1 CaCl2, 1 MgCl2, 10 TEA-Cl, 10 HEPES, pH 7.35 (NaOH), 280 mmol/kg (TEA suppresses K+ channels)',-80.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OSCA-EX-00035','mean P 50 values fell between -69.7 ± 5.9 mmHg (-100 mV, n = 11) and -74.8 ± 5.9 mmHg (-40 mV, n = 12) ( Fig. 2 D ), suggesting that the half-point of pressure sensitivity was independent of the holding potential','Results (voltage dependence of P50; Fig 2, C and D; -100 mV endpoint)','high','the two endpoints of the -120 to -20 mV holding-voltage series (''mean P50 values fell between ... and ...''); P50 is voltage independent (P = 0.87, mixed-effects REML). NILOY ARCHIVE (not rowed): patch amplitudes 19.2 ± 3.7 pA (n = 40, TMEM63A) / 0.7 ± 0.1 pA (n = 32, GFP-only) / 8.4 ± 2.0 pA (n = 26, +Gd3+) are CURRENTS (no parameter_kind home). Gd3+ 30 µM halves the current and leaves P50 unchanged (-65.4 ± 5.3, ROWED as a modulator-conditioned p50) — no Hill fit -> no ic50 row (round ruling: own-data IC50 fits only); GsMTx4 5 µM qualitative. Cell-size covariate strata (Fig 4): >20 pF cells P50 -70 ± 3 mmHg, τACT 672 ± 124 ms (30 cells, 45 ± 4 pF, Imax 111 ± 19 pA); <20 pF cells P50 -66 ± 4 mmHg, τACT 273 ± 34 ms (17 cells, 11 ± 1 pF, Imax 16 ± 2 pA) — archived as covariate analysis (Imax values are currents). Whole-cell equi-biaxial PDMS stretch + GCaMP5 Ca2+ imaging (1-15%, 3-12 s): fluorescence metrics, not channel parameter rows. tau_inact = N explicitly (TMEM63A ''lack[s] inactivation over 5 s''). conductance/ion_selectivity = N (I-V linear, scaling with the driving force; no E_rev value). Error convention: means ± SE (methods).','hTMEM63A_HEK293T-P1KO_cell-attached_HSPC_hold--100mV_Boltzmann-P50_Fig2D','11','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',132,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
