 ruling: own-data IC50 fits only); GsMTx4 5 µM qualitative. Cell-size covariate strata (Fig 4): >20 pF cells P50 -70 ± 3 mmHg, τACT 672 ± 124 ms (30 cells, 45 ± 4 pF, Imax 111 ± 19 pA); <20 pF cells P50 -66 ± 4 mmHg, τACT 273 ± 34 ms (17 cells, 11 ± 1 pF, Imax 16 ± 2 pA) — archived as covariate analysis (Imax values are currents). Whole-cell equi-biaxial PDMS stretch + GCaMP5 Ca2+ imaging (1-15%, 3-12 s): fluorescence metrics, not channel parameter rows. tau_inact = N explicitly (TMEM63A ''lack[s] inactivation over 5 s''). conductance/ion_selectivity = N (I-V linear, scaling with the driving force; no E_rev value). Error convention: means ± SE (methods). [F-004:verbatim-semi] '';'' junction(s) confirmed in archived corpus (classified 2026-08-31)','hTMEM63A_HEK293T-P1KO_cell-attached_HSPC_-100mmHg_-80mV_tau_act_Fig2B','7','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',132,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
