 mmHg'' loss-of-function -> value_relation ''<'' with the as-printed -200 bound; no error term. n = 3 independent cells, mean ± SEM (legend). delta_p50: the paper states shifts only qualitatively -> no delta_p50 rows; compare against the rowed WT endpoint. SHAN ARCHIVE (not rowed): conductance Y-flag -> the paper''s ''single-channel conductance ... is -10 ± 1 pA'' (WT and F516A, -60 mV) and the lyso-PC-activated ''~-6 pA'' F516A current are UNITARY CURRENTS in pA, not pS conductance -> NO conductance rows (round ruling 4; pS-vs-pA hazard declared). delta_p50 Y-flag -> no numeric shift magnitude is stated anywhere (''slightly lower'', ''slightly reduce'') -> mutant ENDPOINT rows only; arithmetic deltas forbidden. Cryo-EM kink angles (M3a 75 deg, M4a 34 deg, M5a 79 deg, M6a 46 deg; lyso-PC M6b movement ~54 deg) are structural descriptors, no parameter_kind home. Low expression of F516A -> smaller microscopic currents (qualitative). [F-004:composite] multi-span assembly (2 fragments all verbatim in archived corpus; assembled quote not contiguous in source; classified 2026-08-31)','AtOSCA1.1-G480A_HEK293T-P1KO_cell-attached_HSPC_-50-to--200mmHg_Boltzmann-P50_-60mV_Fig7b','3','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',135,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
