', ''slightly reduce'') -> mutant ENDPOINT rows only; arithmetic deltas forbidden. Cryo-EM kink angles (M3a 75 deg, M4a 34 deg, M5a 79 deg, M6a 46 deg; lyso-PC M6b movement ~54 deg) are structural descriptors, no parameter_kind home. Low expression of F516A -> smaller microscopic currents (qualitative).','AtOSCA1.1-K537A_HEK293T-P1KO_cell-attached_HSPC_-50-to--200mmHg_Boltzmann-P50_-60mV_Fig7d','3','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',135,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
