INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(370,'MAIC:BX:00370',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'stretch-activated currents in cell-attached patches: stepwise 300-ms negative pressure pulses (10-mmHg increments, 2 s between stimuli) via a high-speed pressure clamp (HSPC-1, ALA Scientific); patch potential held at -80 mV; P50 from Boltzmann fits of I-P curves | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 11.2','P50',-123.3,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-123.3','mmHg','PRESSURE_CLAMP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CELL_ATTACHED','HEK293T cells transiently transfected with human TMEM63A or TMEM63B (or Arabidopsis OSCA1.2 / its monomeric mutants); macroscopic and single-channel currents recorded 4-12 h after seeding (24-48 h post transfection)','HEK293T',NULL,7.3,'(per the referenced HEK293T protocol)','130 NaCl, 5 KCl, 10 HEPES, 10 TEA-Cl, 1 CaCl2, 1 MgCl2, pH 7.3 (NaOH); 3-5 MOhm',-80.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OSCA-EX-00063','As shown in Figure 3E , the pressure required for half-maximal activation (P 50 ) of human TMEM63A (-123.3 ± 11.2 mmHg) or TMEM63B (-134.2 ± 11.4 mmHg) was significantly larger than that for OSCA1.2 (-85.9 ± 5.2 mmHg).','Results (TMEM63s form high-threshold mechanosensitive ion channels; Figure 3E)','high','monomeric human TMEM63A in HEK293T (cell-attached). error type not stated for this sentence (no SEM/SD label found in the paper''s quantification section) -> error_type blank. delta_p50 flag: the TMEM63-vs-OSCA1.2 threshold difference is stated without a numeric shift -> compare rowed endpoints; no delta row. ZHENG ARCHIVE (not rowed): TMEM63A/B unitary conductance UNRESOLVED (''not able to resolve single-channel currents of TMEM63s, which were probably too small to be detected''; proteoliposome: ''No single-channel current was resolved'') -> no TMEM63 conductance rows (round ruling 4). The rowed 129±3 / 133 / 126±5 / 57±5 pS values are AtOSCA1.2-subclade (SELF-subclade -> rowable per the round ruling; gene checked per quote). Imax values (310.2±85.1 pA OSCA1.2 HEK; 155.4±20.9 pA liposome; 18.7±3.1 / 16.3±1.8 pA TMEM63A/B liposome; 171.6±25.5 / 120.8±33.2 pA 5Mu / 63A-IL2; 2.6±0.2 pA empty liposomes) are currents. delta_p50 Y-flag -> no numeric mmHg shift stated (''substantially higher P50'') -> endpoint rows only; arithmetic forbidden. ion_selectivity ''unclear'' -> qualitative acidic-neck pore inference (E571/D584 -> K mutants only reduce currents) -> no row. Gd3+ reduces TMEM63A Imax by 76% (percent, no fit) -> no row. Single-channel open-dwell times (OSCA1.2 3.5±0.3 ms; 5Mu 1.8±0.2 ms) have no tau_* home (open-state lifetimes, not activation/inactivation) -> archived. OSCA1.2-E531K concatemer unitary currents (11 / 3 / 7 pA) archived. MD-simulation ''~120 pS as expected for OSCA1.2'' is a simulation expectation, not a measurement.','hTMEM63A_HEK293T_cell-attached_HSPC_300ms-pulses_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig3E',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',136,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
