round ruling; gene checked per quote). Imax values (310.2±85.1 pA OSCA1.2 HEK; 155.4±20.9 pA liposome; 18.7±3.1 / 16.3±1.8 pA TMEM63A/B liposome; 171.6±25.5 / 120.8±33.2 pA 5Mu / 63A-IL2; 2.6±0.2 pA empty liposomes) are currents. delta_p50 Y-flag -> no numeric mmHg shift stated (''substantially higher P50'') -> endpoint rows only; arithmetic forbidden. ion_selectivity ''unclear'' -> qualitative acidic-neck pore inference (E571/D584 -> K mutants only reduce currents) -> no row. Gd3+ reduces TMEM63A Imax by 76% (percent, no fit) -> no row. Single-channel open-dwell times (OSCA1.2 3.5±0.3 ms; 5Mu 1.8±0.2 ms) have no tau_* home (open-state lifetimes, not activation/inactivation) -> archived. OSCA1.2-E531K concatemer unitary currents (11 / 3 / 7 pA) archived. MD-simulation ''~120 pS as expected for OSCA1.2'' is a simulation expectation, not a measurement.','hTMEM63B_HEK293T_cell-attached_HSPC_300ms-pulses_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig3E',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',136,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(372,'MAIC:BX:00372',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'stretch-activated currents in cell-attached patches: stepwise 300-ms negative pressure pulses (10-mmHg increments, 2 s between stimuli) via a high-speed pressure clamp (HSPC-1, ALA Scientific); patch potential held at -80 mV; P50 from Boltzmann fits of I-P curves | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 5.2','P50',-85.9,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-85.9','mmHg','PRESSURE_CLAMP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CELL_ATTACHED','HEK293T cells transiently transfected with human TMEM63A or TMEM63B (or Arabidopsis OSCA1.2 / its monomeric mutants); macroscopic and single-channel currents recorded 4-12 h after seeding (24-48 h post transfection)','HEK293T',NULL,7.3,'(per the referenced HEK293T protocol)','130 NaCl, 5 KCl, 10 HEPES, 10 TEA-Cl, 1 CaCl2, 1 MgCl2, pH 7.3 (NaOH); 3-5 MOhm',-80.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OSCA-EX-00065','As shown in Figure 3E , the pressure required for half-maximal activation (P 50 ) of human TMEM63A (-123.3 ± 11.2 mmHg) or TMEM63B (-134.2 ± 11.4 mmHg) was significantly larger than that for OSCA1.2 (-85.9 ± 5.2 mmHg).','Results (Figure 3E; dimeric OSCA1.2 baseline)','high','dimeric Arabidopsis OSCA1.2 baseline in the same HEK293T assay. error type not stated for this sentence (no SEM/SD label found in the paper''s quantification section) -> error_type blank. delta_p50 flag: the TMEM63-vs-OSCA1.2 threshold difference is stated without a numeric shift -> compare rowed endpoints; no delta row. ZHENG ARCHIVE (not rowed): TMEM63A/B unitary conductance UNRESOLVED (''not able to resolve single-channel currents of TMEM63s, which were probably too small to be detected''; proteoliposome: ''No single-channel current was resolved'') -> no TMEM63 conductance rows (round ruling 4). The rowed 129±3 / 133 / 126±5 / 57±5 pS values are AtOSCA1.2-subclade (SELF-subclade -> rowable per the round ruling; gene checked per quote). Imax values (310.2±85.1 pA OSCA1.2 HEK; 155.4±20.9 pA liposome; 18.7±3.1 / 16.3±1.8 pA TMEM63A/B liposome; 171.6±25.5 / 120.8±33.2 pA 5Mu / 63A-IL2; 2.6±0.2 pA empty liposomes) are currents. delta_p50 Y-flag -> no numeric mmHg shift stated (''substantially higher P50'') -> endpoint rows only; arithmetic forbidden. ion_selectivity ''unclear'' -> qualitative acidic-neck pore inference (E571/D584 -> K mutants only reduce currents) -> no row. Gd3+ reduces TMEM63A Imax by 76% (percent, no fit) -> no row. Single-channel open-dwell times (OSCA1.2 3.5±0.3 ms; 5Mu 1.8±0.2 ms) have no tau_* home (open-state lifetimes, not activation/inactivation) -> archived. OSCA1.2-E531K concatemer unitary currents (11 / 3 / 7 pA) archived. MD-simulation ''~120 pS as expected for OSCA1.2'' is a simulation expectation, not a measurement.','AtOSCA1.2_HEK293T_cell-attached_HSPC_300ms-pulses_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig3E',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',136,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
INSERT INTO "biophysics_experiment" VALUES(373,'MAIC:BX:00373',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'patch on visible unilamellar proteoliposome membranes; stepwise 300-ms negative pressure pulses (HSPC-1, 10-mmHg increments), patch potential -80 mV | ERROR-AS-REPORTED: 9.1','P50',-142.6,'mmHg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'-142.6','mmHg','PRESSURE_CLAMP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'RECONSTITUTED_PROTEOLIPOSOME','purified TMEM63A / TMEM63B / OSCA1.2 protein reconstituted into liposomes by the dehydration-rehydration (D&R) method; excised-patch recordings on unilamellar proteoliposomes','proteoliposome (purified TMEM63A/B or OSCA1.2 protein)',NULL,7.3,'140 KCl, 10 HEPES, 1 MgCl2, 10 glucose, pH 7.3 (KOH)','130 NaCl, 5 KCl, 10 HEPES, 10 TEA-Cl, 1 CaCl2, 1 MgCl2, pH 7.3 (NaOH)',-80.0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OSCA-EX-00066','Akin to recordings in HEK293T cells, the P 50 of TMEM63A (-142.6 ± 9.1 mmHg) or TMEM63B (-143.9 ± 7.3 mmHg) was substantially higher than OSCA1.2 (-86.9 ± 6.4 mmHg) ( Figure 4D ), supporting the characteristic high-threshold mechanosensitivity for monomeric TMEM63s.','Results (proteoliposome recordings; Figure 4D)','high','monomeric human TMEM63A, purified-and-reconstituted (D&R proteoliposome) — force-from-lipids isolation. liposome P50s are ~20 mmHg more negative than the HEK cell-attached values for the same proteins (rowed separately per preparation). error type not stated -> blank. ZHENG ARCHIVE (not rowed): TMEM63A/B unitary conductance UNRESOLVED (''not able to resolve single-channel currents of TMEM63s, which were probably too small to be detected''; proteoliposome: ''No single-channel current was resolved'') -> no TMEM63 conductance rows (round ruling 4). The rowed 129±3 / 133 / 126±5 / 57±5 pS values are AtOSCA1.2-subclade (SELF-subclade -> rowable per the round ruling; gene checked per quote). Imax values (310.2±85.1 pA OSCA1.2 HEK; 155.4±20.9 pA liposome; 18.7±3.1 / 16.3±1.8 pA TMEM63A/B liposome; 171.6±25.5 / 120.8±33.2 pA 5Mu / 63A-IL2; 2.6±0.2 pA empty liposomes) are currents. delta_p50 Y-flag -> no numeric mmHg shift stated (''substantially higher P50'') -> endpoint rows only; arithmetic forbidden. ion_selectivity ''unclear'' -> qualitative acidic-neck pore inference (E571/D584 -> K mutants only reduce currents) -> no row. Gd3+ reduces TMEM63A Imax by 76% (percent, no fit) -> no row. Single-channel open-dwell times (OSCA1.2 3.5±0.3 ms; 5Mu 1.8±0.2 ms) have no tau_* home (open-state lifetimes, not activation/inactivation) -> archived. OSCA1.2-E531K concatemer unitary currents (11 / 3 / 7 pA) archived. MD-simulation ''~120 pS as expected for OSCA1.2'' is a simulation expectation, not a measurement.','hTMEM63A_proteoliposome-D&R_excised-patch_HSPC_300ms-pulses_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig4D',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',136,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
