u / 63A-IL2; 2.6±0.2 pA empty liposomes) are currents. delta_p50 Y-flag -> no numeric mmHg shift stated (''substantially higher P50'') -> endpoint rows only; arithmetic forbidden. ion_selectivity ''unclear'' -> qualitative acidic-neck pore inference (E571/D584 -> K mutants only reduce currents) -> no row. Gd3+ reduces TMEM63A Imax by 76% (percent, no fit) -> no row. Single-channel open-dwell times (OSCA1.2 3.5±0.3 ms; 5Mu 1.8±0.2 ms) have no tau_* home (open-state lifetimes, not activation/inactivation) -> archived. OSCA1.2-E531K concatemer unitary currents (11 / 3 / 7 pA) archived. MD-simulation ''~120 pS as expected for OSCA1.2'' is a simulation expectation, not a measurement.','hTMEM63B_proteoliposome-D&R_excised-patch_HSPC_300ms-pulses_Boltzmann-P50_-80mV_Fig4D',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',136,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
