s; Na+-dependence (NMDG-Cl vs Na-gluconate) qualitative; mouse mutant MmTMC1-H353A / MmTMC2-H406A E_revs 0.99 ± 0.48 / 0.33 ± 1.13 mV -- ROWED as two scale-v1 rework rows (review M2) with the quote re-verified from the Cell Press page (cache extended with the full STAR Methods this batch); single-channel open-probability-vs-pressure figure data.','hTMC2_HEK293T-Piezo1KO_shUROD_poking_-60mV_current-decay-from-peak_Fig4G',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',147,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
