ss page (cache extended with the full STAR Methods this batch); single-channel open-probability-vs-pressure figure data.','hTMC1_HEK293T-Piezo1KO_shUROD_linear-I-V_-60-to-+60mV_8um-stimuli_Fig6A-B-E',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',147,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
