ls report mean ± SD for bars — error_type left blank. Table 1 mirror values agree except D528N conductance (Table 1 prints 53.3 ± 2.9, text 53.5 ± 2.9 — text value rowed, discrepancy declared) and control P_Ca/P_Cs error (Table 1 4.25 ± 0.35 (N = 8) matches). PRIOR-WORK rows NOT rowed: M412K (86.2 ± 8.2 pS, P_Ca/P_Cs 1.50 ± 0.12; effects previously shown in Beurg et al., 2015a and Corns et al., 2016) and D569N (87.5 ± 4.5 pS, 1.25 ± 0.11, N_MET 46 ± 18; Beurg et al., 2019). Archived non-rows: macroscopic currents (1.18 ± 0.16 nA control etc.) and N_MET channel counts (166 ± 23 / 123 ± 12 / 157 ± 14 / 54-58 ± 13); resting open probabilities P_OR (0.44 ± 0.06 control; 0.22 ± 0.06 T416K; 0.39 ± 0.01 D528N) and low-Ca2+ current ratios (1.54 ± 0.1 etc.) — population fractions, no parameter_kind home; unitary currents (-7.0 pA examples; 7.1 / 4.6 pA D528N) — currents not conductance; ΔE_rev-only statement ''Reversal potential in Tmc1+/+; Tmc2−/− is ∼7 mV positive to that in Tmc1 p.T416K/T416K'' (shift, no absolute endpoints stated) -> no row; GsMTx4/curare FM1-43 qualitative. delta_p50 flag: the Ca2+-induced x1 change (control 29 -> 6.9 nm; T416K 23 -> 23.6 nm, ''no effect on x1'') is NOT stated as a number — endpoints rowed as the x50 rows; no delta row (arithmetic forbidden). [F-004:verbatim-semi] '';'' junction(s) confirmed in archived corpus (classified 2026-08-31)','mTmc1_OHC_apex_Tmc2-KO_T416K-homo_1.5mM-Ca_bundle-vibration_Boltzmann-x1_Fig3C-D',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',148,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
