Ca/P_Cs 6.7 ± 0.2 (genotype implied not stated in span -> not rowed); conductance flag -> no numeric row (''similar unitary conductance''; Fig 1 values figure-only; paper explicitly disputes Pan 2013''s conductance claim). Anti-pore/skeptic paper. [F-004:verbatim-semi] '';'' junction(s) confirmed in archived corpus (classified 2026-08-31)','mTmc1+mTmc2_OHC_apex_Tmc1-WT_P4-P6_0.04mMCa2+_-84mV_single-Boltzmann-X0.5_Fig2',NULL,'LITERATURE','2026-11-08',153,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
