fpl5+/+ control 58 ± 8 nm) — same experiment, declared on both rows for loader dedup. Pro-pore context (TMC1/2 as pore subunits; the paper''s own thesis is LHFPL5 as the force-transmission element).','mTmc1+mTmc2_OHC_apex_Lhfpl5-KO_P5_single-Boltzmann-XO','10','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',166,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
