xpressed/co-reconstituted internal standard; MscL/MscS ratio 1.33-1.84 = MscL-relative comparative quantitation) -> never rowed. EPR spin-label mobility and MD pore geometry are not channel parameters. Archive spans in literature/raw/extract_quotes_supplemental-v1.json.','E. coli AW737KO spheroplast WT MscL + MscS reference (Duru 2026), first channel opening pressure, +30 mV','>10','LITERATURE','2026-11-08',130,'2026-11-08 00:00:00.000000',NULL);
